  unitName: Archer Lario
  unitId: 30021
  unitNumber: 31
  description: A hunter living in the forest on the outskirts of the Principality
    of Vriksha. As he was locally famous as an expert bowman, many visited from afar
    to witness his skills. He also liked to show off, and was always happy to demonstrate
    his abilities. One day he was invited to the palace of the Principality. it is
    said this incident changed his fate.
  summonDesc: Ah! A Summoner!<br>I'll be your friend.<br>I'll also lend you my bow!
  fusionDesc: Watch this!<br>My abilities have improved!
